  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There seem to still be worlds where you can't drop portals correctly. Most walkable surfaces don't work. But there are some geometry off in the distance that works.\n\nHad the same problem before as stated in this post. That one is resolved and that world works as intended now. \n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1355-problems-with-portal-drop\n\nBut I now have found similar problems in this world. All people in the instance have the same problem. Mixed between betas and live.\n\nwrld_a8838c3f-51e5-4c77-9a5d-0f6a9806999e\n\nVideo showing problem: https://youtu.be/AVqywP5SUcQ",
